abstract: >-
  Research notebooks for multilingual cloze-based trait attribution in English,
  Italian, and Persian. Includes datasets, six model configurations, response
  merging, cross-language agreement analysis, and answer-order comparisons.
keywords:
  - cross-lingual evaluation
  - representational fairness
  - trait attribution
  - multilingual language models
  - research software
